+## Sales import and variance
+
+`POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }` and
+answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }` (new tickets; portions sold). Known
+tickets are skipped. One bad row or shortage rejects the whole file; the
+message starts with `row N` (`row 2` is the first data row).
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=&to=` answers, per item, `theoretical`, `actual`
+and `difference` (actual - theoretical) for those days (inclusive).
